OL,3,CProgramme listings for TUE 7 APR
OL,4,G0930FEssential Classics
OL,5,     GGeorgia Mann plays the best in
OL,6,     Gclassical music, with discoveries
OL,7,     Gand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,8,     Gwith familiar favourites.
OL,9,G1300FClassical Live
OL,10,     GLiszt and Rachmaninov take
OL,11,     Ginspiration from ancient
OL,12,     Gplainsong and Stravinsky looks to
OL,13,     Gthe past for his commedia
OL,14,     Gdell'arte infused ballet
OL,15,     GPulcinella, plus Chopin from
OL,16,     GPerth.
OL,17,G1600FComposer of the Week: Gershwin
OL,18,     GDonald Macleod explores the years
OL,19,     Gafter George Gershwin's huge
OL,20,     Gsuccess with Rhapsody in Blue.
